{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNRasterTileSource(im)initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","roleHeading":"Instance Method","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","kind":"identifier"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a raster tile source initialized with an identifier and configuration"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"URL."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnrastertilesource\/initwithidentifier:configurationurl:"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"- ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"instancetype"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"initWithIdentifier:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSString"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"configurationURL:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"NSURL","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSURL","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"configurationURL","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A string that uniquely identifies the source in the style to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which it is added."}]}],"name":"identifier"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A URL to a TileJSON configuration file describing the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"source’s contents and other metadata.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"configurationURL"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An initialized raster tile source.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"After initializing and configuring the source, add it to a map view’s style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"using the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle\/addSource:"},{"type":"text","text":" method."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The URL may be a full HTTP or HTTPS URL or canonical URL. The URL should"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"point to a JSON file that conforms to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TileJSON specification"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If a Mapbox URL is specified, this source uses a tile size of 256. For all"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"other tilesets, the default value is 512. (See the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" documentation for more information about tile"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sizes.) If you need to use a tile size other than the default, use the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:tileSize:"},{"type":"text","text":" method."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterTileSource"]]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterTileSource\/initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNStyle/addSource:":{"title":"addSource:","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"text":"addSource:","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnstyle\/addsource:","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Adds a new source to the current style."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle\/addSource:"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize":{"abstract":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSNumber"},{"text":" object containing a floating-point number that specifies the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"width and height (measured in points) at which the map displays each raster","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"image tile when the map’s zoom level is an integer. The raster tile source","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"scales its images up or down when the map’s zoom level falls between two","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"integers.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlntilesourceoptiontilesize","title":"MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize","type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNStyle":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"The proxy object for the current map style.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnstyl